      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The comedy peaked when the stars vanished from the punchline's lineup due to injury, leaving their league-leading offense a shell of itself. The sweepers delivered the ultimate punchline in the conference final, executing a defensive joke on a top offense and completing the clean sweep punchline to advance to the championship series qualification.",
