    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "From the absurd late-season coup that installed the interim coach, to his improbable hot streak, the narrative was pure theater. The punchline's collapse was sealed by the stars vanishing, while the sweepers delivered the defensive joke on a top offense, culminating in a clean sweep punchline on May 26. Now, the ultimate prize awaits the ringmaster's troupe.",
